       (q:Entity {id: 2})
--
ERROR: Cannot insert value of type MAP<STRING, INT64> into dynamic property 'dyn_prop': MAP<STRING, INT64> does not support conversion to JSON [at 5:34]
       -[e:Connection {dyn_prop: MAP_FROM_ARRAY([('k', 1)])}]->
                                 ^
==

